            "html": "<h2 style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Hi {{ personalization_token('contact.firstname', 'there') }}!</span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\">Now that you've explored the research and instructional approach behind effective math intervention, see how those concepts translate into real classroom instruction.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 150%;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\">See how educators can use TouchMath<sup>®</sup> to implement intervention quickly, build student confidence, and support skill development without having to create materials from scratch.</span></p>",
